//! The `animation-timeline` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! specifies the timeline used to control the progress of a CSS animation.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: The animation's timeline is the document's default `DocumentTimeline`. This is the
//! default value.
//! - none: The animation is not associated with a timeline, and no animation occurs.
